description: gin-kit project architecture and workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` — it describes this project's project type, layout, and rules.
Handlers bind request DTOs from `internal/dto` (`httpx.BindJSON[T]`) and wrap
responses with `New<Name>Response` mappers; services take DTOs and return
domain values; `context.Context` flows through every boundary; migrations are
versioned SQL. Keep the OpenAPI description in sync when routes change. Run
`gin-kit check` after changes.

For OAuth-enabled projects, preserve PKCE/state/nonce validation,
verified-email linking, and the rule that provider tokens never enter logs,
models, or responses.
